"\t\t\t%printf(\"HF Transformer core material = 2605SA1, 25C\\n  Intial Permat"
"ivity=%d,\\n  Saturated Permativity=%d,\\n  Saturation Flux Density=%d,\\n  R"
"emanance Flux Density=%d,\\n  Saturation Field Strength=%d\\n  Coercive Field"
