"V058Z N0F6J N0EVY DC=0\n"
"X$M059Z N0EWX N0F6H N0FM4 TJ Z0024 PARAMS: N0FG1={N0F41} N0FHD={N0F43} N0FHO="
"{N0F4C} N0FI0={N0F29} N0FMA={N0F49}\n"
"V05AK N0EVY N0FM4 DC=0\n"
